ofs.Corollary8.addFreeDay_correct","semanticId":"Lax117284Proofs.Corollary8.addFreeDay_correct","tooltipHtml":"On the added day every client is served, and on the old days nothing has changed."},"p:Lax117284Proofs.Corollary8.addFreeDay_dayIndepP":{"href":"../lax-117284/Lax117284Proofs.Corollary8.addFreeDay_dayIndepP.html","incident":["e:Lax117284Proofs.Corollary8.addFreeDay_dayIndepP:conclusion:Lax117284.Corollary8.addFreeDay_dayIndepP:0"],"kind":"proof","label":"Every day of the instance, old or new, gives a client the processing time it has on the\nfirst day.","nodeId":"p:Lax117284Proofs.Corollary8.addFreeDay_dayIndepP","semanticId":"Lax117284Proofs.Corollary8.addFreeDay_dayIndepP","tooltipHtml":"Every day of the instance, old or new, gives a client the processing time it has on the\nfirst day."},"p:Lax117284Proofs.Hardness.manyOne_blockingDay":{"href":"../lax-117284/Lax117284Proofs.Hardness.manyOne_blockingDay.html","incident":["e:Lax117284Proofs.Hardness.manyOne_blockingDay:assumption:Lax117284.Corollary8.addBlockingDay_correct:0","e:Lax117284Proofs.Hardness.manyOne_blockingDay:assumption:Lax117284.Corollary8.addBlockingDay_dayIndepP:0","e:Lax117284Proofs.Hardness.manyOne_blockingDay:assumption:Lax117284.Corollary8.reduceBlockingDay_polyTime:0","e:Lax117284Proofs.Hardness.manyOne_blockingDay:conclusion:Lax117284.Corollary8.manyOne_blockingDay:0"],"kind":"proof","label":"","nodeId":"p:Lax117284Proofs.Hardness.manyOne_blockingDay","semanticId":"Lax117284Proofs.Hardness.manyOne_blockingDay"},"p:Lax117284Proofs.Hardness.manyOne_freeDay":{"href":"../lax-117284/Lax117284Proofs.Hardness.manyOne_freeDay.html","incident":["e:Lax117284Proofs.Hardness.manyOne_freeDay:assumption:Lax117284.Corollary8.addFreeDay_correct:0","e:Lax117284Proofs.Hardness.manyOne_freeDay:assumption:Lax117284.Corollary8.addFreeDay_dayIndepP:0","e:Lax117284Proofs.Hardness.manyOne_freeDay:assumption:Lax117284.Corollary8.reduceFreeDay_polyTime:0","e:Lax117284Proofs.Hardness.manyOne_freeDay:conclusion:Lax117284.Corollary8.manyOne_freeDay:0"],"kind":"proof","label":"","nodeId":"p:Lax117284Proofs.Hardness.manyOne_freeDay","semanticId":"Lax117284Proofs.Hardness.manyOne_freeDay"},"p:Lax117284Proofs.Machine.BlockFinal.reduceBlockingDay_polyTime":{"href":"../lax-117284/Lax117284Proofs.Machine.BlockFinal.reduceBlockingDay_polyTime.html","incident":["e:Lax117284Proofs.Machine.BlockFinal.reduceBlockingDay_polyTime:conclusion:Lax117284.Corollary8.reduceBlockingDay_polyTime:0"],"kind":"proof","label":"The reduction is a word RAM program on the zeros and ones of its input: a one-pass tokenizer\nreads the numbers of the instance, a first pass over the table checks that every job takes\nsome time and is not due before it starts, and that the parameter is one, a second pass finds\nthe largest due date, and the numbers of the output are written cell by cell, the closed form of\nevery cell of the new table being computed from its row and column. An instance without clients\nis answered with the instance without clients and one more day, and a word that is not the code\nof such an instance is answered with the rejected word. The numbers may be exponential in the\nlength of the input, which the word length of a polynomial-time word RAM accommodates, and\npolynomial time on the word RAM transfers to a Turing machine.","nodeId":"p:Lax117284Proofs.Machine.BlockFinal.reduceBlockingDay_polyTime","semanticId":"Lax117284Proofs.Machine.BlockFinal.reduceBlockingDay_polyTime","tooltipHtml":"The reduction is a word RAM program on the zeros and ones of its input: a one-pass tokenizer\nreads the numbers of the instance, a first pass over the table checks that every job takes\nsome time and is not due before it starts, and that the parameter is one, a second pass finds\nthe largest due date, and the numbers of the output are written cell by cell, the closed form of\nevery cell of the new table being computed from its row and column. An instance without clients\nis answered with the instance without clients and one more day, and a word that is not the code\nof such an instance is answered with the rejected word. The numbers may be exponential in the\nlength of the input, which the word length of a polynomial-time word RAM accommodates, and\npolynomial time on the word RAM transfers to a Turing machine."},"p:Lax117284Proofs.Machine.FreeFinal.reduceFreeDay_polyTime":{"href":"../lax-117284/Lax117284Proofs.Machine.FreeFinal.reduceFreeDay_polyTime.html","incident":["e:Lax117284Proofs.Machine.FreeFinal.reduceFreeDay_polyTime:conclusion:Lax117284.Corollary8.reduceFreeDay_polyTime:0"],"kind":"proof","label":"The reduction is a word RAM program on the zeros and ones of its input: a one-pass tokenizer\nreads the numbers of the instance, a first pass over the table checks that every job takes\nsome time and is not due before it starts, a second pass finds the largest processing time of\nthe first day, and the numbers of the output are written — the old table, then the new day,\nwhose due dates are that gap times one, two, and so on. A word that is not the code of such an\ninstance is answered with the rejected word. The numbers may be exponential in the length of\nthe input, which the word length of a polynomial-time word RAM accommodates, and polynomial\ntime on the word RAM transfers to a Turing machine.","nodeId":"p:Lax117284Proofs.Machine.FreeFinal.reduceFreeDay_polyTime","semanticId":"Lax117284Proofs.Machine.FreeFinal.reduceFreeDay_polyTime","tooltipHtml":"The reduction is a word RAM program on the zeros and ones of its input: a one-pass tokenizer\nreads the numbers of the instance, a first pass over the table checks that every job takes\nsome time and is not due before it starts, a second pass finds the largest processing time of\nthe first day, and the numbers of the output are written — the old table, then the new day,\nwhose due dates are that gap times one, two, and so on. A word that is not the code of such an\ninstance is answered with the rejected word. The numbers may be exponential in the length of\nthe input, which the word length of a polynomial-time word RAM accommodates, and polynomial\ntime on the word RAM transfers to a Turing machine."},"p:Lax117284Proofs.WordCorrect.corollary8_blocking_correct":{"href":"../lax-117284/Lax117284Proofs.WordCorrect.corollary8_blocking_correct.html","incident":["e:Lax117284Proofs.WordCorrect.corollary8_blocking_correct:assumption:Lax117284.Corollary8.addBlockingDay_correct:0","e:Lax117284Proofs.WordCorrect.corollary8_blocking_correct:assumption:Lax117284.Corollary8.addBlockingDay_dayIndepP:0","e:Lax117284Proofs.WordCorrect.corollary8_blocking_correct:conclusion:Lax117284.Corollary8.reduceBlockingDay_correct:0"],"kind":"proof","label":"The image of a word encoding an instance with `m` days and parameter `1` is the code of the instance with a blocking client and a blocking day added; a word with another parameter is rejected, so the parameter of the word is `1` whenever its image is a yes-instance.","nodeId":"p:Lax117284Proofs.WordCorrect.corollary8_blocking_correct","semanticId":"Lax117284Proofs.WordCorrect.corollary8_blocking_correct","tooltipHtml":"The image of a word encoding an instance with <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span> days and parameter <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span> is the code of the instance with a blocking client and a blocking day added; a word with another parameter is rejected, so the parameter of the word is <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span> whenever its image is a yes-instance."},"p:Lax117284Proofs.WordCorrect.corollary8_free_correct":{"href":"../lax-117284/Lax117284Proofs.WordCorrect.corollary8_free_correct.html","incident":["e:Lax117284Proofs.WordCorrect.corollary8_free_correct:assumption:Lax117284.Corollary8.addFreeDay_correct:0","e:Lax117284Proofs.WordCorrect.corollary8_free_correct:assumption:Lax117284.Corollary8.addFreeDay_dayIndepP:0","e:Lax117284Proofs.WordCorrect.corollary8_free_correct:conclusion:Lax117284.Corollary8.reduceFreeDay_correct:0"],"kind":"proof","label":"The image of a word encoding an instance with `m` days and parameter `k` is the code of the instance with a day added and the parameter `k + 1`; conversely the days, the parameter and the day-independence of the image give those of the word.","nodeId":"p:Lax117284Proofs.WordCorrect.corollary8_free_correct","semanticId":"Lax117284Proofs.WordCorrect.corollary8_free_correct","tooltipHtml":"The image of a word encoding an instance with <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></s